  "description": "Voron Tap is a mechanical probing system that uses the nozzle itself as the probe. The entire toolhead moves vertically on a rail, and an optical switch detects when the nozzle contacts the bed surface. This eliminates XY offset between the probe and nozzle, providing highly accurate Z measurements on any bed surface.",
